{% call m.section("white", class="portal-hub") %}
  <h2 class="portal-hub__title">Your Central Hub for Creative Collaboration</h2>
  <p class="portal-hub__lede">Discover a more innovative way to oversee your custom garment projects. Our <a href="{{ site.portalUrl }}">customer portal</a> consolidates all the essential tools you need in one place, giving you full visibility and saving you time.</p>
  <div class="card-grid card-grid--2">
    {% call m.card("User-Friendly Dashboard", "dashboard", "inline") %}
      <p>Get a complete overview of all your projects the moment you log in. Your personalized dashboard displays project statuses, recent activity, and pending approvals at a glance, so you always know what needs your attention.</p>
    {% endcall %}
    {% call m.card("Instant Design Approval", "approval", "inline") %}
      <p>Reviewing and approving designs is now simpler than ever. You can leave feedback directly on the creative, request modifications, and finalize approval with just one click. Our system maintains a record of all versions, ensuring complete clarity for you and your team.</p>
    {% endcall %}
    {% call m.card("Streamlined Project Oversight", "hierarchy", "inline") %}
      <p>Effortlessly monitor progress from concept to completion. Track milestones, view timelines, and access all project-related files and communications in one organized space.</p>
    {% endcall %}
    {% call m.card("Intuitive Navigation", "navigation", "inline") %}
      <p>Move through your projects with ease. Our clean layout and straightforward navigation mean you'll find exactly what you need without a learning curve. Spend less time searching and more time making an impact.</p>
    {% endcall %}
  </div>
{% endcall %}

